    "body": "With setting nits aside, I have a question - when no `reason` is given to `AbortController.abort()`, should `AbortController.reason` be `undefined`, or an `AbortError`? I think `undefined` is simpler and I prefer the option if there is no reason to create a new `AbortError`.",
