    "body": "I don't have strong opinions about `signal.reason` vs `signal.abortReason`, but I was thinking that if someone uses an `AbortSignal` object, despite it being called `signal`, they would still know it is related to \"aborting\" which is why I thought `signal.reason` might be okay. However, if you think `signal.abortReason` is clearer, then I can change it to that too 😊",
